WEBVTT

00:01.950 --> 00:06.850
The first requirement for queenship, 
commanding a holy beast,

00:07.350 --> 00:09.960
has been achieved with flying colors.

00:09.960 --> 00:12.940
Lady Sariphi may attempt the next task at—

00:12.940 --> 00:16.320
Sariphi only just finished your ordeal.

00:16.320 --> 00:19.410
There is no need to rush her.

00:19.650 --> 00:21.560
If you say so, sire.

00:21.560 --> 00:27.280
I merely thought that Lady Sariphi would 
wish to wed you as soon as possible.

00:27.550 --> 00:33.790
More importantly, Anubis, what have you 
learned about the intruders in my palace?

00:33.790 --> 00:37.180
Justice Set is putting them 
to the question as we speak.

00:38.220 --> 00:45.180
Such petty criminals could not 
have entered without inside help.

00:45.380 --> 00:49.330
We cannot overlook any 
threat to Your Majesty.

00:50.670 --> 00:55.180
Forgive me for interrupting this council, 
but I have a report on that matter.

00:55.620 --> 00:56.930
What is it, Set?

00:56.930 --> 01:01.740
I put the scoundrels to the question, 
as His Majesty commanded,

01:01.740 --> 01:05.660
but both of them have just 
taken their own lives.

01:06.840 --> 01:08.570
This is unacceptable, Set!

01:09.000 --> 01:10.950
My most humble apologies.

01:11.290 --> 01:13.350
But please, have no fear.

01:13.350 --> 01:17.390
I found no indication of any 
mastermind behind their crimes.

01:17.600 --> 01:22.210
We may safely assume that they 
snuck in to burgle the palace.

01:22.470 --> 01:29.620
They claimed—truly, I believe—to have 
fired impulsively upon seeing a human.

01:30.110 --> 01:35.460
Regrettably, the people hold humans 
to be the most abominable of creatures.

01:35.860 --> 01:38.840
Nevertheless, the lady is our future queen.

01:38.840 --> 01:41.860
So, as a loyal servant of the royal family,

01:41.860 --> 01:46.090
I may have been too harsh in my questioning 
of such treasonous individuals.

01:47.550 --> 01:48.960
Remember this:

01:49.470 --> 01:55.280
I will not condone rash killing, 
even of heinous criminals.

01:55.280 --> 01:58.590
Make your sentences worse than death,

01:58.590 --> 02:02.850
so that offenders never think 
of defying me a second time.

02:03.750 --> 02:04.900
Yes, sire.

03:35.980 --> 03:40.990
A Boy and the King of Beasts

03:43.060 --> 03:44.810
Hey! We're on duty!

03:45.110 --> 03:47.110
Sorry. I couldn't help it.

03:47.460 --> 03:52.040
Damn it. If any more scoundrels get in,

03:52.040 --> 03:55.770
the watch captain's demotion to the border 
will look lenient by comparison.

03:55.770 --> 03:57.200
So look sharp!

03:57.200 --> 03:58.920
I know, I know.

03:58.920 --> 04:02.880
We gatekeepers bar the way 
into the royal... palace...

04:07.750 --> 04:12.180
Bring out your king. 
I have business with him.

04:15.620 --> 04:21.040
I made these to celebrate Lady Sariphi 
overcoming her first ordeal.

04:21.720 --> 04:23.300
So crispy and flaky!

04:23.300 --> 04:24.580
They're delicious!

04:24.580 --> 04:25.740
Delicious!

04:26.750 --> 04:29.030
I'm so glad you like them.

04:29.430 --> 04:32.880
I'd love to bake something, too. 
For the king.

04:32.880 --> 04:33.620
Oh!

04:34.360 --> 04:39.820
Lady Sariphi worked herself ragged so 
that she can become queen, didn't she?

04:39.820 --> 04:41.050
That she did!

04:41.050 --> 04:46.550
Th-Then... that terrifying king is the 
gentleman she has feelings for?!

04:46.550 --> 04:48.230
You only just figured that out?

04:52.090 --> 04:55.210
Goodness, what a commotion.

04:56.890 --> 04:58.670
Please be careful, sire.

04:58.670 --> 05:02.960
This man just fought the whole palace watch,

05:02.960 --> 05:05.870
and he remains most unruly.

05:06.100 --> 05:09.330
In any case, this is an 
unprecedented occurrence.

05:09.810 --> 05:12.780
Not only did he violate the treaty 
of mutual noninterference,

05:13.020 --> 05:18.050
but he assaulted the palace alone and 
threatened violence to Your Majesty.

05:18.450 --> 05:20.340
He's like an animal.

05:23.270 --> 05:25.280
So you're the king of beasts?

05:25.900 --> 05:28.690
Did you kill Sariphi?!

05:29.370 --> 05:30.540
Your Majesty!

05:31.320 --> 05:33.610
I heard that someone broke into the palace.

05:33.610 --> 05:35.480
May I have a word with—

05:38.860 --> 05:39.910
Ilya?

05:40.860 --> 05:42.180
Sariphi...

05:42.740 --> 05:44.490
Sariphi, is that you?!

05:44.490 --> 05:46.730
Ilya, what are you doing here?!

05:46.730 --> 05:49.250
Do you know this person, Lady Sariphi?

05:49.250 --> 05:52.130
Yes! Ilya is my...

05:52.510 --> 05:54.000
Oh, okay.

05:54.910 --> 05:58.740
You're still... alive.

06:00.910 --> 06:02.130
Ilya...

06:04.640 --> 06:05.910
Please!

06:06.520 --> 06:08.640
Please pardon Ilya.

06:08.940 --> 06:10.790
It wouldn't do, sire!

06:10.790 --> 06:14.440
Not even beasts may trespass 
in the royal palace!

06:14.440 --> 06:17.890
Custom demands that he be severely punished!

06:18.280 --> 06:19.490
In that case,

06:19.840 --> 06:21.940
I'll accept his punishment instead.

06:22.230 --> 06:23.640
Punish me.

06:24.920 --> 06:25.880
Anubis.

06:25.880 --> 06:26.520
Sire!

06:26.520 --> 06:29.870
What did that man say when 
he appeared before my gates?

06:30.440 --> 06:32.580
According to the gatekeepers,

06:32.580 --> 06:36.270
he said, "Bring out your king. 
I have business with him."

06:37.170 --> 06:38.520
<i>Sire?</i>

06:39.310 --> 06:42.960
In other words, that man is my guest.

06:42.960 --> 06:46.920
He merely didn't know to ring the doorbell.

06:47.890 --> 06:50.040
Y-You cannot mean...

06:50.310 --> 06:53.510
Do you object to <i>my</i> ruling?

06:54.760 --> 06:56.090
Thank you, sire.

06:57.720 --> 06:59.010
Sire?

06:59.010 --> 07:03.190
Why would you go to such 
lengths to save him?

07:03.190 --> 07:05.480
What is that man to you?

07:08.380 --> 07:10.130
We knew each other as kids.

07:10.940 --> 07:15.690
When he was little, evil beasts 
attacked his hometown.

07:15.690 --> 07:20.170
So he went traveling, training 
under the warrior who saved him.

07:20.840 --> 07:22.210
Then, one day...

07:22.210 --> 07:23.940
Ow!

07:27.720 --> 07:29.200
What are you looking at?

07:29.510 --> 07:32.210
You're always sneaking around.

07:34.340 --> 07:36.220
Hey, that hurt!

07:41.030 --> 07:42.430
Medicinal herbs?

07:42.430 --> 07:46.350
Because... you're always hurt.

07:47.900 --> 07:49.720
This is nothing.

07:49.720 --> 07:52.500
You can't train without taking a few bumps.

07:52.940 --> 07:54.160
Train for what?

07:54.470 --> 07:57.870
To become a big, strong man 
who can beat anyone.

07:58.540 --> 08:01.150
So if you're ever in trouble, 
just come to me.

08:03.580 --> 08:08.270
I'll keep you safe, even from the beasts.

08:10.680 --> 08:13.980
Sariphi! I brought you a neat souvenir!

08:14.730 --> 08:18.550
Ilya didn't know I was 
going to be a sacrifice,

08:18.950 --> 08:22.870
so he must have thought 
that he failed to protect me.

08:25.250 --> 08:29.360
Since it's my fault he took this risk,

08:30.000 --> 08:32.590
I felt I had to help him.

08:32.590 --> 08:34.510
Is that really all?

08:37.500 --> 08:38.960
What do you mean?

08:41.470 --> 08:43.570
If you don't know, it doesn't matter.

08:43.570 --> 08:45.710
Go see him at once.

08:46.000 --> 08:47.500
Oh, of course!

08:50.460 --> 08:52.170
Thank you, sire!

08:58.780 --> 09:02.400
<i>How petty I am.</i>

09:03.930 --> 09:06.880
This is a most exceptional circumstance.

09:07.180 --> 09:10.410
His Majesty will release you 
under one condition:

09:10.410 --> 09:14.650
that you never set foot in his realm again.

09:14.650 --> 09:17.610
Be grateful for his royal magnanimity.

09:19.950 --> 09:21.030
Lord Chancellor!

09:21.030 --> 09:22.370
How dare you, scoundrel?!

09:22.370 --> 09:24.030
Do you ever shut up?

09:24.360 --> 09:26.920
<i>You</i> oughta be thanking Sariphi.

09:26.920 --> 09:31.810
If anything had happened to her, 
I'd have lopped off all your heads by now.

09:33.230 --> 09:34.340
Ilya!

09:34.700 --> 09:35.700
Sariphi.

09:35.700 --> 09:37.630
Thank goodness they let you out.

09:38.970 --> 09:39.850
Huh?

09:39.850 --> 09:42.290
W-Wait! What are you doing, Ilya?

09:42.290 --> 09:44.070
Huh? What does it look like?

09:44.390 --> 09:46.020
I'm bringing you home.

09:47.090 --> 09:51.260
If you're all right, they must not 
need you as a sacrifice.

09:51.630 --> 09:54.530
So they've got no right to complain.

09:54.530 --> 09:55.930
Hold it right there!

09:56.910 --> 10:00.070
Sariphi is living here with us.

10:00.070 --> 10:02.070
You can't take her away!

10:02.070 --> 10:03.460
Can't!

10:08.520 --> 10:10.010
Cy! Clops!

10:10.010 --> 10:10.800
Let's go.

10:16.110 --> 10:17.200
Sire!

10:17.550 --> 10:18.790
You!

10:18.790 --> 10:21.430
I can't have you walking off with this girl.

10:21.430 --> 10:24.150
She is to be my queen.

10:28.240 --> 10:31.320
I'll overlook your actions just this once.

10:31.800 --> 10:34.230
Leave while you still live.

10:34.460 --> 10:37.480
Guards! Take him away!

10:37.480 --> 10:38.830
At once, sire!

10:38.830 --> 10:39.670
Wait!

10:42.490 --> 10:44.020
You'll pay.

10:44.670 --> 10:48.930
I swear, I'll make you...

10:50.110 --> 10:51.150
Ilya!

10:52.830 --> 10:53.710
Ilya!

10:54.910 --> 10:56.220
Ilya!

11:02.590 --> 11:04.880
I believe that he is merely fatigued.

11:05.110 --> 11:06.590
Thank goodness.

11:06.590 --> 11:12.010
That said, Lady Sariphi must have concerns 
about sending him home in this state.

11:12.410 --> 11:19.530
Would you consider nursing him here 
overnight before expelling him?

11:19.530 --> 11:21.870
What? Can we really, Mr. Chancellor?

11:21.870 --> 11:26.910
Only if His Majesty approves, of course.

11:27.850 --> 11:30.270
I don't object. Let it be so.

11:30.270 --> 11:32.110
Thank you, sire!

11:32.110 --> 11:35.300
Then I shall make the necessary 
arrangements at once.

11:37.610 --> 11:41.060
Ilya, you really should eat something.

11:41.540 --> 11:42.770
I don't need food.

11:42.770 --> 11:44.910
But you must be hungry.

11:44.910 --> 11:46.260
I'm not.

11:53.460 --> 11:55.990
See? Listen to your tummy growl!

11:56.700 --> 11:59.220
You haven't changed, Ilya.

12:00.340 --> 12:02.510
Always trying to act tough.

12:02.510 --> 12:03.940
It's training.

12:04.500 --> 12:09.400
This really takes me back. 
I never thought I'd see you again, Ilya.

12:10.420 --> 12:14.530
Thank you for coming all this way for me.

12:15.380 --> 12:19.120
It's fine. I'd do anything for you.

12:20.940 --> 12:24.480
Anyway, Sariphi, is what he said true?

12:24.840 --> 12:27.810
That nonsense about you 
marrying the king of beasts?

12:27.810 --> 12:30.410
Oh... Yes, actually.

12:30.900 --> 12:32.290
So that's it.

12:32.290 --> 12:37.410
But don't worry. I promise 
I'll get you out of here.

12:37.750 --> 12:38.780
What?

12:39.170 --> 12:43.250
Escaping this place with you 
will be no problem for me.

12:43.680 --> 12:44.900
Wait a second.

12:44.900 --> 12:47.420
Don't worry about finding a place to live.

12:47.420 --> 12:49.870
I'm in good with plenty of villages.

12:50.270 --> 12:51.200
So...

12:51.920 --> 12:53.560
Come live with me.

12:56.130 --> 12:57.550
Ilya, I...

12:57.550 --> 12:58.610
Excuse me.

13:00.150 --> 13:01.550
Amit!

13:01.550 --> 13:03.810
Lady Sariphi told me about you.

13:04.090 --> 13:07.020
Um... How do you feel?

13:07.400 --> 13:10.720
I think desserts are the 
best thing for exhaustion,

13:11.260 --> 13:14.680
so I baked muffins with some 
nuts I picked this morning.

13:15.120 --> 13:16.720
Please enjoy them together...

13:21.520 --> 13:23.180
Get out. Now.

13:24.760 --> 13:25.870
Monster.

13:28.580 --> 13:30.640
I... I beg your pardon!

13:31.820 --> 13:33.150
Amit!

13:34.760 --> 13:36.410
What's wrong with you, Ilya?!

13:36.410 --> 13:38.020
Amit went out of her way to—

13:40.330 --> 13:42.700
No, what's wrong with <i>you</i>?

13:42.700 --> 13:44.890
Why are you acting buddy-buddy with beasts?

13:46.220 --> 13:52.350
Don't tell me you think their king 
will actually keep you alive?

13:52.990 --> 13:54.440
What do you mean?

13:54.860 --> 13:57.880
He's lying about making you his queen.

13:57.880 --> 14:01.340
Beasts would never treat humans as equals.

14:01.700 --> 14:06.500
You're no more than an exotic pet to him.

14:06.820 --> 14:10.610
When he gets bored of you, 
he'll toss you out like trash.

14:11.820 --> 14:16.870
They only think of us as either prey or toys.

14:19.060 --> 14:23.150
I know that beasts attacked your hometown.

14:23.790 --> 14:28.190
<i>I can't tell him not to 
hold a grudge, but still...</i>

14:28.700 --> 14:30.730
But at least try to understand one thing.

14:31.720 --> 14:33.590
The king isn't like that.

14:35.600 --> 14:37.360
Take the way he treated you.

14:37.360 --> 14:42.330
Favoring a human might harm his position,

14:42.330 --> 14:44.690
but he still made an exception.

14:45.940 --> 14:49.690
<i>He sacrifices his health and peace of mind.</i>

14:50.720 --> 14:53.670
He stood up for me the same way.

14:54.450 --> 15:00.500
I believe in him, and I'm going to 
spend the rest of my life with him.

15:02.750 --> 15:06.090
So I can't go with you, Ilya.

15:16.760 --> 15:18.670
I'll be back with more food.

15:35.710 --> 15:36.860
Lady Sariphi.

15:38.920 --> 15:40.330
Amit...

15:41.200 --> 15:45.560
Whatever is the matter? You look pale.

15:45.560 --> 15:47.800
Don't worry. It's nothing.

15:48.180 --> 15:51.220
More importantly, I'm sorry 
for how Ilya treated you.

15:51.220 --> 15:54.480
Don't be. I was too forward.

15:55.170 --> 15:57.220
You're so kind, Amit.

15:57.550 --> 16:01.060
You know, Ilya is kind, too, deep down.

16:01.280 --> 16:05.720
When I was little, 
I tried to avoid making friends,

16:05.720 --> 16:08.070
because I knew I'd be a sacrifice.

16:08.640 --> 16:09.830
But Ilya was...

16:14.070 --> 16:18.150
Listen, Sariphi. If anybody 
makes you cry, you tell me.

16:18.150 --> 16:21.240
No matter who they are, I'll protect you.

16:22.040 --> 16:26.170
I suppose beasts are just... 
a bit of a sore spot for him.

16:27.120 --> 16:31.530
Even though he was strong, 
he wasn't violent for no reason.

16:32.310 --> 16:33.420
But...

16:36.020 --> 16:37.590
Lady Sariphi?

16:38.750 --> 16:40.350
The way Ilya acted earlier...

16:43.060 --> 16:44.750
<i>That look in his eyes...</i>

16:46.500 --> 16:48.990
...scared me a little.

16:52.650 --> 16:55.070
That concludes the report from Goya.

16:55.420 --> 16:59.080
The royal guard should return from 
Gamakas the day after tomorrow.

17:01.450 --> 17:02.530
Well, now.

17:02.530 --> 17:07.490
She must be taking food to that man. 
What admirable devotion.

17:08.010 --> 17:11.590
Although she forsook her homeland,

17:11.590 --> 17:14.880
Lady Sariphi must feel a special 
affection for old friends.

17:15.430 --> 17:19.220
And above all, she must find comfort

17:19.930 --> 17:22.560
in spending time with a fellow human.

17:25.330 --> 17:27.760
Cy, Clops, wait here.

17:28.070 --> 17:30.090
Ilya might snap at you.

17:30.090 --> 17:33.490
We understand. We don't 
want to get kicked again.

17:33.490 --> 17:34.160
Don't want.

17:34.920 --> 17:36.120
I'm sorry.

17:39.090 --> 17:43.880
<i>Am I frightened of Ilya? 
What's gotten into me?</i>

17:45.210 --> 17:49.930
<i>If I try speaking calmly to him again, 
I'm sure he'll be the Ilya I know.</i>

17:52.970 --> 17:54.090
Ilya.

17:54.600 --> 17:56.290
I brought you dinner.

17:56.750 --> 17:58.900
Try to eat something this time.

18:00.250 --> 18:04.000
Listen, Ilya, can we try 
again to have a proper talk?

18:04.700 --> 18:07.550
We'll have to say goodbye 
to each other tomorrow.

18:08.550 --> 18:14.440
I don't know when we'll see each other 
again. We might never be able to.

18:14.860 --> 18:17.180
I don't want to end things on a sour note.

18:17.690 --> 18:18.630
Yeah.

18:19.150 --> 18:20.350
Ilya...

18:20.350 --> 18:24.340
You're right. I've been 
thinking the same thing.

18:30.800 --> 18:33.270
Sorry, Sariphi.

18:33.950 --> 18:38.920
I'm taking you with me. To somewhere 
that monster can't get you.

18:40.360 --> 18:43.100
What?! Sariphi is gone?!

18:43.100 --> 18:46.350
Sari never left the room, 
but she's not inside it, either!

18:46.350 --> 18:49.170
Th-That man carried her off!

18:49.170 --> 18:50.700
Kidnapped!

18:50.700 --> 18:52.110
B-Begging Your Majesty's pardon!

18:52.370 --> 18:55.560
The human has taken back 
his weapons and fled!

18:58.180 --> 19:00.340
Dispatch a force in pursuit!

19:01.720 --> 19:03.850
No, I'll go myself.

19:04.790 --> 19:07.900
Please wait, sire! You are a king.

19:08.110 --> 19:10.450
You must not act rashly.

19:10.450 --> 19:12.870
Silence! Unless I act swiftly, 
Sariphi will suffer!

19:12.870 --> 19:17.410
Do you truly believe that Lady 
Sariphi was taken against her will?

19:20.270 --> 19:22.690
What are you implying?

19:23.100 --> 19:25.540
Lady Sariphi is human.

19:25.540 --> 19:32.010
Under these circumstances, she might 
quite naturally choose a human man.

19:32.740 --> 19:37.020
And even if she did not, 
this is the realm of beasts.

19:37.020 --> 19:39.530
She will find life here difficult.

19:42.060 --> 19:50.540
Would she not be happier returning to 
live in human lands with a human man?

19:51.410 --> 19:52.520
Sire!

19:52.520 --> 19:54.360
Sari's running out of time!

19:55.440 --> 19:56.790
<i>Sariphi...</i>

19:57.290 --> 20:00.330
<i>If that's where your happiness lies...</i>

20:00.680 --> 20:05.900
<i>If I would be an obstacle to it, then...</i>

20:05.900 --> 20:06.840
Your Majesty!

20:08.510 --> 20:13.150
P-Please, set out after 
Lady Sariphi at once.

20:13.930 --> 20:15.200
Princess Amit?!

20:16.020 --> 20:17.160
<i>What now?</i>

20:17.380 --> 20:23.660
I cannot believe that Lady Sariphi would 
choose to leave with that gentleman.

20:24.480 --> 20:29.310
She risked her own life 
to attempt the ordeals

20:29.930 --> 20:33.490
because she longs to be 
with you with all her heart.

20:34.250 --> 20:37.800
Is that not so, sire?

20:38.670 --> 20:43.510
Princess Amit, kindly refrain from 
such outbursts in the royal presence.

20:44.790 --> 20:47.570
The palace is already in disarray.

20:47.570 --> 20:50.180
If His Majesty were to leave now...

20:50.180 --> 20:51.510
In that case,

20:52.330 --> 20:54.660
allow me to take charge of matters here.

20:55.870 --> 20:57.940
Captain Jormungand!

20:58.690 --> 20:59.740
Jor!

20:59.970 --> 21:02.920
But you weren't due back for two days!

21:02.920 --> 21:06.290
I managed to complete my 
mission ahead of schedule.

21:06.690 --> 21:10.850
Sire, I am your loyal servant.

21:10.850 --> 21:13.090
Command me, and I shall perform

21:13.090 --> 21:15.090
any task Your Majesty desires.

21:28.020 --> 21:30.220
His Majesty's holy beast...

21:30.940 --> 21:33.930
Take charge in my absence, Jormungand.

21:34.260 --> 21:35.100
Yes, sire.

21:35.970 --> 21:37.820
Please wait! Sire!

23:25.950 --> 23:30.910
T-Terrible news, Chancellor Anubis! 
That human man kidnapped Lady Sariphi!

23:30.910 --> 23:32.270
Terrible! Terrible!

23:36.670 --> 23:38.180
Chancellor Anubis just...

23:36.930 --> 23:39.930
Next Episode

23:36.930 --> 23:39.930
A Boy of Love and Hate

23:38.180 --> 23:39.430
...snapped.
